   "id": "math.related-rates",
   "name": "Rates of change in time",
   "requires": [
    "math.chain-rule"
   ],
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "When two quantities are linked by a formula and both change with time, differentiate the formula with respect to t using the chain rule (A = πr² gives dA/dt = 2πr dr/dt). Put in the numbers for that instant only after differentiating. Velocity is dS/dt and acceleration is dv/dt."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "ሁለት መጠኖች በቀመር ሲያያዙና ሁለቱም በጊዜ ሲለወጡ ቀመሩን በ t እንዋጽኦ (dA/dt = 2πr dr/dt)። ቁጥሮቹን ከዋጽኦ በኋላ እናስገባለን።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
